(ENGLISH TRANSLATION:) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(1. Abide with me: fast falls the eventide; the darkness deepens; Lord,) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(with me abide. When other helpers fail and comforts flee, Help of the) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(helpless, O abide with me. 2. Swift to its close ebbs out life's little) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(day; earth's joys grow dim; its glories pass away; change and decay in) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(all around I see; O Thou who changest not, abide with me.) Tj
